C component to a digital interface","target":"eaw-dig-interface-add-sdlc-comp","line":64},{"title":"Manage architectural artifacts of a digital interface in EA Workspace","target":"eaw-manage-artifacts-digital-interface","line":66},{"title":"Add or edit a digital interface in the EA Workspace","target":"eaw-create-digital-interface","line":68},{"title":"Relate credentials to a digital interface","target":"eaw-dig-interface-add-credential","line":70},{"title":"Relate an information object to a digital interface","target":"eaw-dig-interface-add-info-object","line":72},{"title":"Digital interface to API form","target":"eaw-dig-interface-api-form","line":76},{"title":"Working with digital interfaces","target":"eaw-work-with-digital-interfaces","line":77},{"title":"View all digital interfaces","target":"eaw-view-all-dig-interfaces","line":78},{"title":"Relate an SDLC component to a digital interface","target":"eaw-dig-interface-add-sdlc-comp","line":79},{"title":"Manage architectural artifacts of a digital interface in EA Workspace","target":"eaw-manage-artifacts-digital-interface","line":80},{"title":"Add or edit a digital interface in the EA Workspace","target":"eaw-create-digital-interface","line":81},{"title":"Relate credentials to a digital interface","target":"eaw-dig-interface-add-credential","line":82},{"title":"Relate an information object to a digital interface","target":"eaw-dig-interface-add-info-object","line":83},{"title":"Enterprise Architecture Workspace","target":"ea-workspace","line":84}],"metadata":{"title":"Connect a digital interface with the CMDB API in the EA Workspace","description":"Create a relationship between a digital interface and a CMDB API. The relationship helps you find out which digital integration uses which API, which APIs are built out of the design specs of the digital interface, and what environments are deployed. The relationship helps to group the deployed APIs.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r